Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:34:51 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Deploy as an unprivileged Linux user service or Docker
 Compose service

---
 .dockerignore                |  5 +++++
 .gitignore                   |  1 +
 Dockerfile                   | 11 +++++++++++
 compose.yaml                 | 15 +++++++++++++++
 deploy/install-linux.sh      | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 deploy/starnet-nexus.service | 14 ++++++++++++++
 scripts/nexus-health.js      |  9 +++++++++
